## 定理一：径向接触不可能无限平缓

定义

$$
\boxed{
\Gamma(\theta_0)
=
\frac1{2\pi}
\int_{-\pi}^{\pi}
\frac{f_*(\phi)}
{1-\cos(\phi-\theta_0)}
\,d\phi.
}
\tag{5}
$$

那么这个积分有限，并且

$$
\boxed{
-a_c
\left.\frac{\partial f_a(\theta_0)}{\partial a}\right|_{a=a_c}
=
\Gamma(\theta_0)
\ge\frac12.
}
\tag{6}
$$

特别地，

$$
\boxed{
\left.\partial_af_a(\theta_0)\right|_{a_c}
\le-\frac1{2a_c}<0.
}
\tag{7}
$$

END_RAW_TEXT
