### 定理六：每个接触点贡献的负区域与负总量

令

$$
b_j=\left(\frac{A_j}{B_j}\right)^{1/(2m_j)}.
$$

则第 \(j\) 个接触点附近的贡献分别为

$$
\boxed{
d_{-,j}(\delta)
=
\frac{b_j}{\pi}
\delta^{1/(2m_j)}(1+o(1)),
}
\tag{36}
$$

$$
\boxed{
e_{-,j}(\delta)
=
\frac{2m_j}{2m_j+1}
\frac{A_jb_j}{\pi}
\delta^{1+1/(2m_j)}(1+o(1)).
}
\tag{37}
$$

END_RAW_TEXT
